This is a monthly release of Terminaux that brings some of the most promising improvements to make your console applications more powerful!

### Changes

This release contains a variety of changes, including, but not limited to:

- `[+]` Added ability to customize themes further
- `[+]` Added more shell features, such as getting current shell instance
- `[+]` Added color conversion commands from Nitrocid
- `[*]` Significant improvements to shell command class structure
- `[*]` General improvements and bug fixes

Review the commit history if you want to get a deep insight about the changes.

### Feedback?

If you have issues with this version, report to us by [making a new issue ticket](https://github.com/Aptivi/Terminaux/issues/new).

